"At New Year 2041 Earth's new ambassador ordered Worli Ro-den off Earth with all possible haste."
"Stu-art'h built a greeting house of art'h wood at the House of Healing and invited Ro-den."
"Master Leeter-zis's ritual made the house Stu's domain until dawn, when it passed to the healers."
"Caught by the table's courtesy trap, Ro-den released Alden from their secrecy contract in English."
"Stu offered Renjen-art'h's demon hide and to seek Ro-den's service moved under the Rapports' votaries."
"Alden agreed not to spread the Earth Contract's soft spots or the lab's bomb smuggling."
